; claude: s-expressions, the syntax the Lisps share (languages/README.md):
; Sexpr (the tree, each part with its span in the text), Sexpr_read (the
; reader, Emacs Lisp's and Scheme's). languages/lisp's Lisp_read and
; languages/scheme's Scheme_read turn the tree into their own values.
;
; Pure OCaml, no Playground. A private library, installed as part of
; elm_playground.
(library
 (name sexpr)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
)
